	"transcription": [
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:00,000",
				"to": "00:00:03,380"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 3380
			},
			"text": " What if you ignored all the rules of car racing and had a contest which was simply to get"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:03,380",
				"to": "00:00:06,940"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 3380,
				"to": 6940
			},
			"text": " a human being around a track 200 times as fast as possible?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:06,940",
				"to": "00:00:10,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 6940,
				"to": 10520
			},
			"text": " Human biology limits us to Daytona finishing times over an hour."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:10,520",
				"to": "00:00:12,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 10520,
				"to": 12840
			},
			"text": " But what if we dropped the \"survive\" requirement?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:12,840",
				"to": "00:00:15,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 12840,
				"to": 15040
			},
			"text": " How fast can we get the \"vehicle\" to go around the track?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:15,040",
				"to": "00:00:19,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 15040,
				"to": 19040
			},
			"text": " Well, let's imagine a vehicle attached with Kevlar straps to a pivot in the center of"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:19,040",
				"to": "00:00:21,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 19040,
				"to": 21080
			},
			"text": " a similarly sized circular track."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:21,080",
				"to": "00:00:23,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 21080,
				"to": 23100
			},
			"text": " In effect, this is a giant centrifuge."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:23,100",
				"to": "00:00:26,460"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 23100,
				"to": 26460
			},
			"text": " This lets us apply one of my favorite weird equations, which says that the edge of a spinning"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:26,460",
				"to": "00:00:30,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 26460,
				"to": 30240
			},
			"text": " disc can't go faster than the square root of the specific strength of the material it's"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:30,240",
				"to": "00:00:32,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 30240,
				"to": 32080
			},
			"text": " made of or it'll tear itself apart."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:32,080",
				"to": "00:00:35,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 32080,
				"to": 35960
			},
			"text": " For strong materials like Kevlar, this speed is 1 to 2 kilometers per second."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:35,960",
				"to": "00:00:39,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 35960,
				"to": 39520
			},
			"text": " At those speeds, a capsule could conceivably finish the race in about 10 minutes, although"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:39,520",
				"to": "00:00:42,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 39520,
				"to": 42120
			},
			"text": " definitely not with a living driver inside."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:42,120",
				"to": "00:00:46,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 42120,
				"to": 46080
			},
			"text": " What if we build a chute like a bobsled course and send a ball bearing rocketing down it?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:46,080",
				"to": "00:00:48,140"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 46080,
				"to": 48140
			},
			"text": " Sadly, the disc equation strikes again."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:48,140",
				"to": "00:00:51,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 48140,
				"to": 51200
			},
			"text": " The ball bearing can't roll faster than a couple of kilometers per second or it will"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:51,200",
				"to": "00:00:54,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 51200,
				"to": 54000
			},
			"text": " be spinning too fast and it will also tear itself apart."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:54,000",
				"to": "00:00:55,660"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 54000,
				"to": 55660
			},
			"text": " What if we make it slide?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:55,660",
				"to": "00:00:58,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 55660,
				"to": 58920
			},
			"text": " It is one of the toughest materials, so we could imagine a diamond capsule sliding along"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:58,920",
				"to": "00:01:00,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 58920,
				"to": 60280
			},
			"text": " a smooth diamond chute."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:00,280",
				"to": "00:01:04,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 60280,
				"to": 64080
			},
			"text": " However, the sliding would result in substantially more friction than the ball bearing example,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:04,080",
				"to": "00:01:06,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 64080,
				"to": 66300
			},
			"text": " and our diamond might catch fire."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:06,300",
				"to": "00:01:09,980"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 66300,
				"to": 69980
			},
			"text": " To defeat friction, we could levitate the capsule with magnetic fields and make it progressively"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:09,980",
				"to": "00:01:12,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 69980,
				"to": 72840
			},
			"text": " smaller and lighter to accelerate and steer it more easily."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:12,840",
				"to": "00:01:15,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 72840,
				"to": 75760
			},
			"text": " Oops, we've accidentally built a particle accelerator."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:15,760",
				"to": "00:01:19,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 75760,
				"to": 79360
			},
			"text": " The particles in the Large Hadron Collider's beam go very close to the speed of light."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:19,360",
				"to": "00:01:23,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 79360,
